# Emit runtime state when the data directory points inside the repository:
# the SQLite store, its WAL sidecars, the single-instance lock, and the
# 0600 credential file. The default data directory is ~/.emit, outside the repo.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
emit.lock
credentials.json
